# Base URL of the Symfony REST API. Copy to .env.local and adjust if needed.
#
# Unset, the app falls back to its own stub routes (app/api/stub/), so it runs
# with no backend at all — that is the #4 setup.
#
# Deliberately NOT prefixed with NEXT_PUBLIC_: fetching happens in Server
# Components, so this value stays on the server and never reaches the browser.
#
# Once #16 exposes the MART tables over HTTP, point it at Symfony:
#   API_BASE_URL=https://localhost/api
# (Caddy serves that with a locally-trusted certificate; from inside the compose
# network the host is `php` rather than `localhost`.)
#API_BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:3000/api/stub
